        "message": "Add the watchdog's UDP companion path for status and leases\n\nThe perception camera's image publications hold the console server's\nshared gz transport mutex long enough to delay the watchdog's status\nPUBLICATION by p95 ~575 ms under the SAM3 observation load (measured;\nthe fixture's receive path is 0.5 ms median), which the 20 ms\ncapture-bracket joins cannot absorb, and lease delivery showed the\nsame exposure. The watchdog now sends status through a non-blocking\nloopback UDP sendto that no transport mutex can block and listens for\nleases on a dedicated UDP thread feeding the same guard; the native\nlink worker mirrors leases onto that path, and the observation fixture\nreads status from it. All qualified gz paths remain active and\nunchanged; arm/stop services stay on gz. Rebuilds the image chain\nbase->contacts->controller->console (build 24, 4b1ad9db)."
      },
      "type": "Git"
    },
